The chat itself stays.␀␀␀Remove this client's access?␀␀␀␀Set the node's position to this device's position?␀␀This device has no position␀Frequency: 150 to 2500 MHz␀␀%.3f MHz, %g kHz, SF%d, CR%d␀␀␀␀Try new radio settings for %u minutes?
